cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements, cite this repository and the date you retrieved it - these numbers rot."
title: "payload-walls: measured request-size ceilings for LLM APIs"
abstract: >-
  Empirical request-size ceilings (JSON body bytes, per-image bytes, images per request, input tokens)
  for 20 LLM API hosts, with each vendor's documented figure quoted next to the measured one. Includes
  the raw probe logs, the ladder tool that produced them, and a pre-flight checker.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cheah
    given-names: Dan
    email: contact@danielcheah.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/dacheah/payload-walls"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/dacheah/payload-walls/blob/main/LICENSE"
# Measurement data and prose (data/, limits.json, docs/) are additionally CC BY 4.0 —
# see LICENSE-DATA; keep the attribution and the measured_at date with any reuse.
keywords:
  - LLM APIs
  - payload limits
  - rate limits
  - multimodal
  - empirical measurement
date-released: "2026-09-19"
